    <briefdescription>
<para>Combined lookup over the home-node directory and the local LRU cache. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>On the home node (<computeroutput>this_node</computeroutput> == home) locations are stored permanently in the directory; elsewhere they are cached and may be evicted. </para>
